2:T475,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/boom-beach-hammerman-voice#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/boom-beach-hammerman-voice","headline":"Boom Beach Hammerman Voiceover","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/boom-beach-hammerman-voice","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"Meet Hammerman. Guy Harris voices Boom Beach’s iconic baddie with energy and menace. Game villainy at its finest, straight from the battlefield.","datePublished":"2014-09-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2014-09-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["character"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/boom-beach-hammerman-voice.jpg"}}4:T667,<h2>Voicing Boom Beach Videos</h2>
<p>This was one of my favourite voiceover sessions. Not only am I a fan of the game, but I kept seeing Boom Beach trailers pop up on my socials, and always wanted to voice one of them. Then along came the chance.</p>

<p>It was brilliant fun having to lip-sync Hammerman’s lines so the animators could match the character’s mouth to mine. Seeing the final version confirmed what I already suspected, <strong>SuperCell</strong> are absolute legends when it comes to game development and animation.</p>

<p>I’ve voiced a few <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover" title="Character voiceover sessions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">character voices</a> over the years, and this one stands out. If you're casting a new project, you might also enjoy my work on <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lifeless-game-trailer-voice" title="Lifeless Game Trailer Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lifeless</a> or the brilliantly chaotic <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/penarium-game-trailer-voice" title="Penarium Game Trailer Voice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Penarium</a>.</p>

<p>Want something voiced in this style? Take a look at my <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/game-trailer-voice" title="Game trailer voiceover demos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Game Trailer Voice</a> page, or <a href="https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy" title="Contact VoiceoverGuy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">get in touch</a> if you'd like to hear a short sample first. I'm more than happy to help.</p>
5:T547,<h2>Who is Hammerman in Boom Beach?</h2>
<p>Hammerman is the blackguard commander and one of the key villains in Boom Beach. With a blocky square nose, a battle-scarred left eye, and a military-grade scowl, he’s not exactly what you’d call approachable.</p>

<p>Hammerman is known for launching full-scale attacks from multiple enemy bases scattered across the archipelago, dubbed “Hammerman’s HQ.” He’s the thorn in every player’s side, turning up uninvited and smashing your base to bits.</p>

<p>If you fancy diving deeper into his evil escapades, you’ll find a full breakdown on <a href="https://boombeach.fandom.com/wiki/Lt._Hammerman" target="_blank" title="Hammerman Boom Beach Fandom" rel="noopener noreferrer">Boom Beach Fandom</a> and on <a href="https://supercell.com/en/games/boombeach/" target="_blank" title="Official Boom Beach site" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supercell’s official site</a>.</p>

<p>I’ve voiced Hammerman in several versions over the years, including the gloriously bizarre <a href="/boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice" title="Hammerman’s Hot Tub Voice">Hot Tub edition</a>. Yep, he’s a villain who apparently enjoys a soak. Honestly, voicing characters like this is what makes <a href="/character-voiceover" title="Character voiceover work">character voiceover work</a> so much fun.</p>
6:T431,<h2>Need a Character Voice Like Hammerman?</h2>
<p>If you’re creating a game or animation and need a memorable <a href="/character-voiceover" title="Character voiceover">character voiceover</a>, I’d love to help. Voicing characters like Hammerman is always a joy – whether it's for villains, heroes, or something completely off-the-wall. If you're not quite sure what voice you need, I'm happy to offer a short demo before you book me.</p>

<p><a href="mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Character%20Voice%20Enquiry" title="Contact Guy">Drop me a line</a>, let me know what you’re working on, and we’ll see if my voice is the right fit. I’ve worked with brilliant teams like Supercell, and I aim to turn around most projects within 24 hours.</p>

<p>And if you're just browsing, feel free to explore more of my <a href="/character-voiceover" title="Character Voiceover Styles">character voiceover styles</a> and <a href="/game-trailer-voice" title="Game Trailer Voiceovers">game trailer voiceovers</a>. You might find just the tone you’re after!</p>
